# Asterbloom

Original Eufloria-inspired browser strategy game. No ripped assets, names, or trademarks.

Stack: TypeScript, Vite, Pixi.js v8, Vitest. Do not add dependencies unless asked.

Layers:

- `src/game/sim/` — pure simulation, no Pixi
- `src/game/render/` — views only; do not mutate `World`
- `src/game/input/` — pointer/camera → `commands.ts`
- `src/main.ts` — boot, ticker, HUD

Balance constants live in `src/game/sim/types.ts`. Change them there.
